WEBVTT

00:08.425 --> 00:11.428
Ah! Quite tasty, if I say so myself!

00:12.137 --> 00:13.304
Now to finish it off.

00:17.976 --> 00:19.477
Hey, sorry, Mutsumi.

00:19.561 --> 00:21.479
What is it, Taiyo?

00:22.355 --> 00:24.441
H-How do you put on a bra, again?

00:25.608 --> 00:29.112
M-Mutsumi! It's not what you think!
This is just--

00:29.195 --> 00:30.780
I-It's all right.

00:31.865 --> 00:36.077
No matter what kind of inclinations
you may have, I'll embrace them.

00:36.161 --> 00:39.039
Uh, no! I was only
practicing my disguise skills!

00:39.122 --> 00:40.790
Please look me in the eye!

00:42.625 --> 00:46.421
All right, then,
shall I show you how it's done?

00:46.504 --> 00:47.547
Who are you?

00:47.630 --> 00:49.674
Kengo! You're not doing that again?

00:49.758 --> 00:51.259
Kengo?

00:51.968 --> 00:53.344
Come on, now!

00:53.428 --> 00:55.764
Hey, Mutsumi. You wouldn't
happen to know where Taiyo...

00:55.847 --> 00:57.432
Don't you like this?

00:57.515 --> 01:00.435
Hey, don't force it on me.
Can you be more gentle? Hey!

01:00.518 --> 01:03.646
I guess every married couple
does things differently...

01:03.730 --> 01:05.148
This is a misunderstanding!

01:05.231 --> 01:10.153
What? Are you saying our relationship's
a misunderstanding, too?

01:10.236 --> 01:12.822
Hey! What are you talking about, Kengo?

01:12.906 --> 01:14.657
That makes me sad!
- Huh? Kengo?

01:14.741 --> 01:17.202
I'm telling you,
this is all a misunderstanding!

01:17.285 --> 01:20.413
Taiyo, you're no fun.

01:20.497 --> 01:22.707
Play along with me a little more.

01:22.791 --> 01:24.000
I don't want to!

01:25.085 --> 01:26.544
Morning, Mutsumi!

01:27.087 --> 01:32.008
Your big bro's about to go on a mission,
so come on and kiss me goodbye!

01:48.733 --> 01:55.406
YOZAKURA FAMILY

03:12.317 --> 03:13.902
PLAN 4
KENGO/SHINZO

03:13.985 --> 03:15.904
Pretty rough morning
for you, huh?

03:17.447 --> 03:20.992
Oh, are you heading out
on a mission now, Big Bro Shinzo?

03:21.075 --> 03:22.702
Yeah. That's right.

03:23.203 --> 03:25.496
Is it a tough mission?

03:25.580 --> 03:27.749
Nope. Just a low-level mission,

03:27.832 --> 03:31.377
retrieving the original plate
for counterfeit money,

03:31.461 --> 03:32.629
so it shouldn't take long.

03:32.712 --> 03:34.589
<i>That's low-level?</i>

03:34.672 --> 03:36.674
Hey, almost forgot.

03:36.758 --> 03:40.553
Taiyo, there's something
I wanted to give you.

03:40.637 --> 03:41.638
Huh?

03:44.807 --> 03:45.975
Seriously...

03:46.434 --> 03:50.605
I can't believe Kengo and Big Bro
Kyoichiro's early-morning antics!

03:55.652 --> 03:56.653
Watch out!

03:59.989 --> 04:01.241
A no-look catch?

04:08.248 --> 04:09.540
H-Hey, you!

04:09.624 --> 04:12.001
We'd love for you to join our team!

04:17.757 --> 04:18.967
Ahh...

04:19.050 --> 04:20.551
Listen, Taiyo...

04:20.635 --> 04:22.053
Huh? What's up?

04:22.136 --> 04:25.390
You don't seem to have noticed,
but you're becoming

04:25.473 --> 04:28.101
more and more superhuman
thanks to your training.

04:28.184 --> 04:30.228
If you're not careful,
you'll give yourself away.

04:30.311 --> 04:31.312
Huh?

04:31.396 --> 04:34.357
They can't sense your presence
or hear your footsteps,

04:34.440 --> 04:36.985
so people are calling you "ninja"
behind your back these days.

04:37.068 --> 04:38.069
Ninja...

04:38.653 --> 04:39.654
My bad.

04:39.737 --> 04:41.030
Cheer up!

04:41.489 --> 04:43.199
Here! "Ahh!"

04:44.325 --> 04:47.245
<i>Wouldn't this kind of thing
make me stick out, too?</i>

04:48.538 --> 04:50.039
Ahh...

04:50.123 --> 04:51.165
Hey.

04:51.249 --> 04:53.584
I almost forgot!

04:53.668 --> 04:56.629
Taiyo, are you free after school today?

04:56.713 --> 05:00.675
There's something I'd like you
to help me out with when we get home.

05:00.758 --> 05:03.094
Uh, sure, that's fine with me.

05:03.177 --> 05:04.220
Thanks!

05:08.808 --> 05:11.102
YOZAKURA

05:19.277 --> 05:22.322
Item number three.
Compensation is short by $100,000.

05:22.405 --> 05:23.489
Check with the client.

05:23.573 --> 05:26.743
The return on this apartment complex
is less than 5%, so I'm rejecting it.

05:26.826 --> 05:30.204
Tell them to write up a proposal for 5.5%.

05:30.747 --> 05:32.665
C-Copy that.

05:32.749 --> 05:36.586
I don't know how you do it,
sorting all these stacks of documents.

05:36.669 --> 05:38.254
Well, I'm used to it.

05:38.338 --> 05:41.090
This kind of administrative work
is part of the head's job, too.

05:41.174 --> 05:44.719
Real estate management,
funding, investing stocks.

05:44.802 --> 05:46.637
R-Right.

05:46.721 --> 05:51.017
Once in a while, Big Bro Kyoichiro
sneaks in fake divorce papers,

05:51.100 --> 05:53.478
- so make sure you burn every page.
- Hmm?

05:53.561 --> 05:54.562
PETITION FOR DIVORCE

05:54.645 --> 05:55.855
As you wish.

05:57.023 --> 05:58.524
Kengo again, huh?

05:58.608 --> 05:59.776
Mm?

06:00.568 --> 06:01.569
KENGO'S ROOM

06:01.652 --> 06:04.572
Kengo? We're coming in.

06:04.655 --> 06:06.282
What? No way.

06:06.366 --> 06:08.868
I'm super busy playing a game right now.

06:08.951 --> 06:09.952
Mm.

06:10.286 --> 06:12.789
STOP

06:13.373 --> 06:15.666
This place is a huge mess.

06:15.750 --> 06:19.128
Hey, come on, you two.

06:19.754 --> 06:22.173
You're invading my privacy!

06:22.256 --> 06:24.300
<i>Where'd he come from?</i>

06:24.384 --> 06:28.012
Look, you! You forgot to attach
the paperwork for a report again.

06:28.096 --> 06:30.181
Now get out of there right now!

06:30.264 --> 06:31.891
What a stickler!

06:31.974 --> 06:36.479
A missing attachment or two,
what difference does it make?

06:36.562 --> 06:38.356
<i>And where did</i> that <i>come from?</i>

06:38.439 --> 06:40.858
You're as sloppy as ever, aren't you?

06:40.942 --> 06:44.112
I bet it's buried somewhere around here.

06:45.405 --> 06:48.408
I'll look, too,
so why don't you join us, Kengo?

06:48.491 --> 06:51.244
I wouldn't do that if I were you.
- Huh?

06:51.327 --> 06:54.038
Since there are
guns and hand grenades in the pile, too.

06:54.122 --> 06:55.123
Whoa!

06:55.206 --> 06:56.541
Not to mention...

06:59.085 --> 07:02.004
I never do anything that's a hassle!

07:02.088 --> 07:04.632
I'm a free spirit!

07:06.342 --> 07:07.635
At least put some clothes on.

07:08.136 --> 07:09.554
Huh? Not happening.

07:09.637 --> 07:13.141
My skin's exhausted from all
those disguises, and I'm healing it now.

07:13.224 --> 07:16.519
At least make an effort to
hide it in front of your younger sister.

07:16.602 --> 07:20.898
Oh, come on! Back in the day,
you and I bathed together, remember?

07:20.982 --> 07:22.900
You'd say, "Big Bro! Big Bro!"

07:22.984 --> 07:25.153
And you'd always be clinging to me!

07:25.236 --> 07:27.613
You sure were adorable back then.

07:27.697 --> 07:29.615
Back then?

07:29.699 --> 07:31.325
These days, you're such a nag,

07:31.409 --> 07:33.911
and you've really grown
into that mom role.

07:33.995 --> 07:36.664
Mutsumi?

07:37.165 --> 07:40.501
I think it's time
that I disciplined you, no?

07:41.252 --> 07:43.504
As the head of the Yozakura family.

07:50.261 --> 07:51.262
Oh!

07:55.349 --> 07:57.518
Oh, crap!

07:57.602 --> 07:58.895
Naive of you.

08:00.396 --> 08:02.315
Hibernation, activate.

08:32.011 --> 08:35.431
SHION MAGNIFIERS
ZOOM, X-RAY, VIDEO RECORDING, ETC.

08:41.479 --> 08:43.648
<i>Technology this sophisticated...</i>

08:43.731 --> 08:45.358
<i>how on earth...</i>

08:45.775 --> 08:49.153
<i>Not only that,
but this airtight security system...</i>

08:49.862 --> 08:54.617
Well, well! Mr. Director. I am honored
that you would visit us directly.

08:55.076 --> 08:56.702
Looks like it's going well.

08:56.786 --> 09:00.081
Yes, the counterfeit bills
produced by our company

09:00.164 --> 09:02.416
now command 60% of the market.

09:02.500 --> 09:04.877
We've also secured an overseas pipeline.

09:05.503 --> 09:08.548
We have that youngster to thank, don't we?

09:08.631 --> 09:12.260
<i>I knew it. There's someone else
pulling all the strings.</i>

09:24.355 --> 09:26.440
A double trap?

09:29.485 --> 09:31.153
MUTSUMI'S ROOM

09:32.446 --> 09:34.740
Looks like he's not in my room.

09:35.866 --> 09:39.120
I never knew you had
all these hobbies, Mutsumi.

09:39.203 --> 09:40.746
Well, a lot of the time,

09:40.830 --> 09:42.999
I couldn't go out
because someone was after me.

09:43.082 --> 09:45.501
They were the perfect outlets for stress.

09:45.585 --> 09:49.046
And you've depicted the cause
of your stress in your artwork.

09:50.047 --> 09:51.257
SHION'S ROOM
KEEP OUT!

09:51.340 --> 09:54.176
Big Sis Shion! I'm coming in!

09:55.469 --> 09:58.097
Playing hide-and-seek
with Kengo again?

09:58.764 --> 10:02.226
There's no sign of him
having come this way!

10:04.895 --> 10:06.230
YOU DIED!
YOU ARE NOT EXERCISING!

10:06.314 --> 10:09.317
Damn it!
No wonder I suck at physical games!

10:09.400 --> 10:11.444
<i>Then maybe
you should just not play them?</i>

10:11.527 --> 10:13.321
Thanks, Big Sis Shion.

10:14.447 --> 10:18.367
There'd be hell to pay if he woke up
Big Sis Futaba, so he wouldn't be here.

10:18.993 --> 10:21.537
I don't think
he came here, either.

10:21.621 --> 10:23.289
If he were here, he'd die, you know.

10:23.372 --> 10:24.457
Thanks!

10:29.420 --> 10:31.631
Not here, either, huh?

10:31.714 --> 10:33.924
This room is so posh!

10:34.675 --> 10:37.136
W-Wow!

10:38.095 --> 10:40.264
He's not here, either.

10:41.057 --> 10:42.224
That leaves only...

10:42.308 --> 10:43.309
KYOICHIRO

10:49.815 --> 10:51.192
Hey, Mutsumi...

10:51.275 --> 10:52.693
Let's move on now!

10:53.277 --> 10:55.279
I don't have the energy to waste on this.

11:00.201 --> 11:01.869
He's not here, huh?

11:01.952 --> 11:04.163
You think maybe he's outside by now?

11:04.246 --> 11:07.708
We're good.
There's no escaping Hibernation.

11:07.792 --> 11:08.793
And besides...

11:09.418 --> 11:11.337
What's going on, you two?

11:11.420 --> 11:14.048
Just standing around there...

11:14.131 --> 11:16.801
We still can't find Kengo.

11:16.884 --> 11:19.261
You're playing hide-and-seek
with Kengo again?

11:19.345 --> 11:20.346
What?

11:20.429 --> 11:22.848
Where have you all been till now, Big Sis?

11:22.932 --> 11:25.810
We were compiling the data
on the product we confiscated

11:25.893 --> 11:28.104
from that drug cartel we busted last week.

11:28.187 --> 11:31.816
Turns out it was third-rate stuff
of only 10% purity.

11:31.899 --> 11:34.318
Times are tough everywhere, huh?

11:34.402 --> 11:37.738
They used to be quite the infamous cartel.

11:42.910 --> 11:45.454
Th-There he is!

11:45.538 --> 11:47.873
Hey, you finally noticed me!

11:48.999 --> 11:51.043
Come back here!

12:02.638 --> 12:03.764
Whoa!

12:03.848 --> 12:05.224
Taiyo?

12:05.307 --> 12:06.934
Ow, ow, ow.

12:07.017 --> 12:08.853
He threw the whole frame at me.

12:08.936 --> 12:11.355
Are you okay? Where's Kengo?

12:11.439 --> 12:12.690
He went through there.

12:13.274 --> 12:17.069
I've never seen a secret passageway
like this, even on the mansion blueprints!

12:17.153 --> 12:19.655
That Kengo! He went and created it!

12:20.197 --> 12:24.285
So frustrating!
He got away from me!

12:24.368 --> 12:27.288
It's all right, Mutsumi.
You did a good job.

12:29.123 --> 12:30.833
Hibernation... disable.

12:40.134 --> 12:43.262
Oh, well. Let's just start looking
for that paperwork ourselves.

12:43.345 --> 12:44.597
STOP

12:44.680 --> 12:45.681
Right.

12:45.765 --> 12:46.974
Thanks...

12:47.057 --> 12:48.934
Kengo!

12:49.018 --> 12:52.146
What are you talking about,
Mutsumi? I'm...

12:52.229 --> 12:56.400
Under no circumstances is it possible to
escape this mansion during Hibernation.

12:56.484 --> 13:01.822
That's why you needed me to disable it,
no matter what.

13:02.782 --> 13:05.785
<i>The reason you lured Taiyo
wearing that lame disguise</i>

13:05.868 --> 13:08.579
<i>was also to make me disable Hibernation.</i>

13:10.956 --> 13:12.625
I win, right?

13:12.708 --> 13:13.751
And by the way...

13:14.418 --> 13:18.798
<i>when Taiyo opens a door,
he always lets me pass through it first.</i>

13:21.342 --> 13:25.763
Your attention to detail regarding
the people you replicate is phenomenal,

13:25.846 --> 13:27.932
but you still have some work to do

13:28.015 --> 13:30.726
before you can really see
my husband and me.

13:33.354 --> 13:35.523
<i>Kengo, you're a big brother now.</i>

13:36.232 --> 13:39.568
<i>I want you to hold tight
onto Mutsumi's hand.</i>

13:58.045 --> 14:00.422
Oh, man, you got me.

14:00.506 --> 14:02.424
No wonder you're the head!

14:04.468 --> 14:06.554
Sorry for what I did before, Taiyo.

14:06.637 --> 14:09.014
Oh, hey...
It's no big deal for me.

14:09.557 --> 14:12.560
And Mutsumi seemed like
she was actually enjoying herself.

14:12.643 --> 14:14.520
Hmm.
Huh?

14:14.603 --> 14:16.188
Hey, Taiyo.

14:16.272 --> 14:19.108
From now on, you're not allowed
to speak to me so formally, okay?

14:19.191 --> 14:20.818
What? But...

14:20.901 --> 14:22.695
I mean, I'm only a year older than you,

14:22.778 --> 14:25.281
so it kind of
gives me the creeps, you know?

14:25.865 --> 14:26.866
Okay?

14:28.075 --> 14:30.202
Hey! I found the paperwork!

14:30.286 --> 14:33.706
Hey, that's our Taiyo!
Dependable all the time, yo!

14:33.789 --> 14:37.960
Jeez, just listen to you, Kengo.

14:40.296 --> 14:41.881
She got me!

14:41.964 --> 14:44.425
YOU PROMISED NOT TO DISPLAY THESE
WITHOUT MY PERMISSION

14:48.304 --> 14:50.890
Mutsumi!

14:52.433 --> 14:55.019
Mmm! So good!

14:55.102 --> 14:57.354
This curry tastes amazing!

14:57.438 --> 14:59.773
Really? I'm so glad to hear that!

15:02.359 --> 15:05.738
<i>Come to think of it...
Big Bro Shinzo's late.</i>

15:06.280 --> 15:07.656
Is something wrong?

15:07.740 --> 15:09.074
No, no.

15:09.158 --> 15:12.328
Anyway, is there some kind
of secret ingredient in here?

15:12.411 --> 15:15.164
I added some cyanide
to the spices, I guess?

15:16.957 --> 15:19.043
There's more if you want!

15:20.669 --> 15:23.297
I'll get that!

15:24.423 --> 15:26.759
THE BLACK SAKURA PHONE
THE FAMILY'S EXCLUSIVE HOTLINE

15:26.842 --> 15:28.719
From Big Bro Shinzo?

15:29.678 --> 15:30.721
Yes? Hello?

15:30.804 --> 15:34.433
<i>Mutsumi!
Save me!</i>

15:34.516 --> 15:36.894
Is everything all right?
I'll switch it to video chat.

15:36.977 --> 15:39.438
<i>M-M-M-M-M-Mutsumi!</i>

15:39.521 --> 15:41.148
Calm down, Big Bro.

15:41.231 --> 15:42.900
<i>I can't!</i>

15:42.983 --> 15:44.652
Now, now, at times like these,

15:44.735 --> 15:46.987
you count how many rounds
your guns can hold, remember?

15:47.071 --> 15:48.155
<i>What does that mean?</i>

15:48.238 --> 15:50.741
<i>The derringer holds two.</i>

15:50.824 --> 15:55.204
<i>The combat holds six. The Glock holds 17.</i>

15:55.287 --> 15:56.872
<i>He's really counting!</i>

15:56.956 --> 15:59.083
<i>So you're saying
that you exchanged shots,</i>

15:59.166 --> 16:01.168
<i>but there were more of the enemy
than you thought,</i>

16:01.251 --> 16:02.628
<i>so you used up all your weapons?</i>

16:02.711 --> 16:06.090
Without my weapons, I'm... I'm...

16:06.173 --> 16:11.553
<i>Big Bro Shinzo is a weapons
expert, but unarmed, he's a super-wimp.</i>

16:11.637 --> 16:13.764
<i>I can't believe
he survived till now.</i>

16:13.847 --> 16:15.099
So...

16:17.267 --> 16:18.268
Huh?

16:18.352 --> 16:20.688
DO NOT ENTER

16:26.193 --> 16:27.194
<i>Is this a field trip?</i>

16:27.277 --> 16:28.654
Taiyo, can you hear me?

16:28.737 --> 16:29.738
<i>Yeah.</i>

16:29.822 --> 16:30.906
Okay, good.

16:30.990 --> 16:34.451
I'm going to navigate
while I also soothe Big Bro, okay?

16:34.535 --> 16:35.536
<i>Gotcha.</i>

16:35.619 --> 16:38.372
<i>Taiyo,
please don't overdo it, okay?</i>

16:38.455 --> 16:39.540
Right!

16:44.837 --> 16:47.131
<i>Once upon a time,
on a certain battlefield,</i>

16:47.214 --> 16:50.926
<i>there lived a mercenary grandpa
and a combat-obsessed grandma.</i>

16:51.010 --> 16:53.303
<i>The grandpa would go up the mountain
to hunt stragglers</i>

16:53.387 --> 16:55.597
<i>while the grandma
would go to the river to massacre...</i>

16:55.681 --> 16:57.516
<i>How is this soothing?</i>

16:58.434 --> 17:00.602
Hey, kid. Who are you?

17:01.770 --> 17:04.898
To deal with guns behind you,
you need agility more than anything.

17:05.983 --> 17:08.235
<i>By deliberately pushing back,</i>

17:08.318 --> 17:11.447
<i>you can neutralize
a semi-automatic gun's firing mechanism.</i>

17:11.530 --> 17:15.868
<i>Lock both the gun and his hand under
your arm, then clobber him on the chin.</i>

17:20.873 --> 17:22.916
<i>Taiyo, are you all right?</i>

17:23.000 --> 17:25.169
What was that noise I heard?
This way!

17:25.252 --> 17:28.255
<i>Don't panic. Focus.</i>

17:30.257 --> 17:33.093
<i>There are three enemies.
Armed with guns and knives.</i>

17:34.511 --> 17:35.596
Found him!

17:38.307 --> 17:39.433
Damn you...

17:41.602 --> 17:42.853
What, stab-proof clothes?

17:49.735 --> 17:50.986
<i>This is...</i>

17:51.070 --> 17:52.154
for me?

17:52.237 --> 17:53.238
Yeah.

17:53.322 --> 17:56.575
Since you'll be going on missions, too.

17:57.076 --> 17:59.078
I'm sure it will come in handy.

18:01.497 --> 18:02.873
<i>Thank you very much!</i>

18:04.625 --> 18:07.419
YOZAKURA SELF-DEFENSE GUN "YAE"
EIGHT MILLION VOLTS OUTPUT

18:12.091 --> 18:15.844
<i>The rain of blood splatter
from the MP5's barrage...</i>

18:15.928 --> 18:18.138
<i>gave Little Red Riding Hood
an even darker shade of red...</i>

18:19.556 --> 18:21.934
- Taiyo!
- Big Bro Shinzo!

18:22.476 --> 18:23.644
I'm so glad you're okay.

18:23.727 --> 18:25.729
Here, this is the gun
Mutsumi asked me to bring--

18:25.813 --> 18:28.899
I was so scared!

18:29.441 --> 18:32.611
This scent of steel
and brass and gunpowder...

18:32.694 --> 18:35.614
The sheen of the barrel
and the grittiness of the grip...

18:35.697 --> 18:38.951
- Don't you think we should retreat now?
- The bump made by the front sight...

18:39.827 --> 18:41.120
There they are!

18:42.704 --> 18:43.705
Huh?

18:46.625 --> 18:48.127
In a split second?

18:48.210 --> 18:51.338
They won't be so quick to fire
at you if you're holding this.

18:51.421 --> 18:52.923
Stay behind me!

19:03.142 --> 19:04.226
<i>So quick...</i>

19:04.309 --> 19:07.187
I think the factory's emergency exit
is the quickest way out of here.

19:07.271 --> 19:08.939
Mutsumi, show us the way.

19:09.022 --> 19:10.023
<i>Right!</i>

19:19.032 --> 19:20.409
This way, Taiyo!

19:33.589 --> 19:34.590
Taiyo!

19:34.673 --> 19:37.467
Move another inch,
and I'll go for his head next.

19:39.303 --> 19:41.263
It'll take less than three minutes for him

19:41.346 --> 19:43.056
to bleed out from a bullet to the thigh.

19:43.140 --> 19:48.228
Don't worry. I'm not going to kill you
until you've given up everything.

19:48.312 --> 19:51.523
If you want to give him first aid,
put down your weapon.

19:57.821 --> 20:01.158
So you're easier
to get through to than they say.

20:02.910 --> 20:06.038
Even Big Bro, who treasures
his weapons more than anything,

20:06.121 --> 20:09.416
will readily relinquish them for
something that he treasures even more.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.460
But if he does that,

20:11.543 --> 20:14.213
he won't be able to protect
the very thing that he treasures.

20:14.296 --> 20:15.422
That's why...

20:17.049 --> 20:19.426
<i>That's why you need to arm him
with this, whatever it takes.</i>

20:20.594 --> 20:22.554
<i>Even if it's far from being a weapon...</i>

20:24.848 --> 20:27.851
<i>anything that feels comfortable
in Big Bro Shinzo's grip...</i>

20:27.935 --> 20:30.062
<i>becomes a powerful weapon.</i>

20:38.445 --> 20:39.863
<i>Damn monster!</i>

20:51.166 --> 20:53.210
Sorry, Taiyo.

20:53.293 --> 20:55.087
If it hadn't been for my carelessness...

20:55.170 --> 20:57.464
No, I'm the one who messed up.

20:57.547 --> 21:00.801
After all, I came to rescue you,
but I ended up dragging you down.

21:00.884 --> 21:03.553
I know I made Mutsumi worry, too.

21:03.637 --> 21:04.888
Come to think of it...

21:04.972 --> 21:07.933
that gun just now,
I think it must be out of bullets.

21:08.016 --> 21:09.893
Will you be okay unarmed?

21:09.977 --> 21:11.436
Don't remind me.

21:11.520 --> 21:13.939
If I think about it,
I know I'm totally going to die.

21:15.107 --> 21:17.651
But it's all good.

21:17.734 --> 21:19.820
From now on, I want to be stronger.

21:19.903 --> 21:21.989
Maybe I can get used to it,
little by little.

21:22.072 --> 21:25.742
Because, see,
I may be like this, but I'm still...

21:25.826 --> 21:29.454
I'm your big bro, after all.

21:32.874 --> 21:33.875
Mm?

21:48.098 --> 21:50.225
Who hired you?

21:50.309 --> 21:54.396
If you give him up right now,
I'll let you off easy...

21:54.479 --> 21:57.899
by just pulverizing
the bones in your limbs.

22:00.944 --> 22:03.196
Like I'd ever tell you...

22:08.577 --> 22:09.578
Now, then...

22:10.412 --> 22:12.080
what's next on the schedule?

23:46.383 --> 23:50.929
NEXT STAGE
INTERROGATION/DATE
